<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — LavaFlea creature port (Pass 16).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `LavaFlea` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `LavaFlea` BodyDef (Bodies_Animal_StarWars.xml) is
  entirely vanilla-part composition (Shell/Elytra/Stomach/InsectHeart/
  Pronotum/InsectHead/Brain/Eye x2/Trunk/InsectMouth/InsectLeg x6) — no
  SW-prefixed part or group anywhere, confirmed by reading the donor's own
  BodyDef directly — defName rename only, ported as RSW_LavaFlea
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  🔑 **Resource, a genuinely new pattern**: LavaFlea's `leatherDef` AND its
  `CompProperties_Shearable`'s `woolDef` BOTH point at the SAME donor def,
  `Leather_LavaFlea` (texPath swresource/Leather_Chitin, the same texture
  path already used by RSW_Leather_Insectine/RSW_Leather_Insectine — reused
  unchanged, no new art) — confirmed directly off the donor's own `<comps>`
  and `<race>` blocks, not assumed. Ported once as `RSW_Leather_LavaFlea`
  and wired to both `leatherDef` and `woolDef`, matching the donor's own
  single-resource double-use. `specificMeatDef` (`Silica_Meat`) ALREADY
  EXISTS as `RSW_Silica_Meat` — no new meat needed. Needs 2 new eggs
  (RSW_EggLavaFleaFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath swresource/EggBeetle,
  newly extracted this pass — a genuinely new texPath, not reused from any
  prior species) — `hatcherPawn` repointed to `RSW_LavaFlea`. All in
  RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml.

  🔑 **Ability, the smallest yet**: the donor's own `specialTrainables` entry
  (`SW_Leap`, Biotech-gated, NOT Odyssey — the donor's own MayRequire attribute
  confirmed directly off its `<race>` block) is a TWO-def pair in the donor
  (AbilityDef + TrainableDef only, no HediffDef — the ability is pure
  movement via vanilla `Verb_CastAbilityJump`/`CastJump`, not a damage or
  debuff effect) — ported this pass as RSW_SW_Leap
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Abilities.xml). soundCast/soundLanding repoint to the
  already-absorbed `RSW_Ability_Leap_Air`/`RSW_Ability_Leap_Land` (589-sound
  wave, 2026-09-02). Wired off RSW_LavaFlea's ThingDef
  `<race><specialTrainables>` only — the donor's own LavaFlea references it
  that way, not via PawnKindDef `<abilities>`.

  `bloodDef` (`Filth_BloodInsect`) is vanilla Core, left bare.

  Sounds for LavaFlea were already absorbed in the 2026-09-02 sound wave
  (`RSW_Pawn_LavaFlea_*`) — confirmed present, wired, not re-done.

  🔴 **Checked, unrelated, untouched**: `Armour_Leather.xml`
  (src/RimStarWars/Armoury/Patches, a separate mod's generator) has 3
  `PatchOperation`s targeting the bare donor `Leather_LavaFlea`'s
  `stuffProps` — out of this item's fauna-geometry scope, same precedent as
  BeastNorm_Law3.xml (Pass 15), left untouched.

  Art: no `LavaFleaArtOverride` mod exists (checked
  `find src/RimStarWars -maxdepth 1 -iname "*ArtOverride*"` first). 8 PNGs
  extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the same AssetBundle
  every prior wave used — `LavaFlea_{south,east,north}` (adult, shared
  texPath at drawSize 3.0/4.0), `LavaFlea_j_{south,east,north}` (larval
  "crystalline worm" juvenile), `LavaFlea_Dessicated`,
  `LavaFlea_j_Dessicated` — all confirmed non-zero and PIL-openable. The
  donor's own `LavaFleaPack_*`/`LavaFlea_jPack_*` variants (pack-saddle
  recolors) are unreferenced by this species' own def and excluded, same
  precedent as Kybuck (this same pass) and every prior Pack-variant species.
  Sits at Textures/swanimals/LavaFlea/.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's own
  ground truth (AB_PyroclasticConflagration, LavaField, Volcano).
-->
<Defs>
